    {
      "name": "preimage_longer_than_240_bytes_is_unpadded",
      "note": "The padding refusal reaches the preimage too: a 241-byte unsigned frame cannot be padded to 512 (gap 271 > 255), so the preimage is the raw frame. An implementation that always pads to a block would diverge here.",
